WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.507
Unit one. Global Health Issues!

2
00:00:04.469 --> 00:00:09.375
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:12.626
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:17.096
Today we learn about Global Health Issues. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.254 --> 00:00:22.587
Global health. Say it with me. Global health!

6
00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:29.818
Pandemic. Say it with me. Pandemic!

7
00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:37.999
Health disparity. Say it with me. Health disparity!

8
00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:47.255
International cooperation. Say it with me. International cooperation!

9
00:00:50.742 --> 00:00:55.309
Disease outbreak. Say it with me. Disease outbreak!

10
00:00:58.865 --> 00:01:03.532
Global initiative. Say it with me. Global initiative!

11
00:01:06.975 --> 00:01:12.042
Health inequality. Say it with me. Health inequality!

12
00:01:15.558 --> 00:01:21.758
Sustainable health system. Say it with me. Sustainable health system!

13
00:01:25.259 --> 00:01:42.521
Global health looks at issues like a pandemic or disease outbreak that cross borders. Health disparity and health inequality often affect the poorest communities most. International cooperation and a global initiative support a sustainable health system.

14
00:01:42.571 --> 00:01:45.978
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:52.177
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:52.227 --> 00:01:53.729
Health disparity!

17
00:01:54.771 --> 00:02:00.086
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:00.136 --> 00:02:01.855
Health inequality!

19
00:02:02.943 --> 00:02:12.949
Did you know? A disease outbreak in one country can spread worldwide within days due to international travel, which is why global cooperation matters.

20
00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.300
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:26.015
Think and answer. Why does global health require international cooperation?

22
00:02:26.065 --> 00:02:27.288
Great answer!

23
00:02:28.351 --> 00:02:33.854
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:36.666
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

